{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルは今言いたい言葉♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人で言うとなんだか寂しいので\n堪えてみたらタイトルで言っちゃいました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はまいやんからマカロン\nもらったよ(∩^ω^∩)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい～♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんはよく私に\nマカロンを恵んでくれるんだ(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/10/22/4299575/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日のANNで16thシングル\nサヨナラの意味が解禁になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもう聴いてくれたかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は16thシングルに関する取材も\nたくさんしていただいたので\nそちらもよろしくです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2016/10/22/4299575/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空綺麗♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回真夏さんリスペクト軍団での\n楽曲、MVが収録されることが\n発表になりました～♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素直に嬉しいです∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しさのあまり決まってすぐに\n軍団員に連絡しました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲もMVも可愛